From 63ea50e5b209cc3515552ec3277e16ca97660a1b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 17:45:45 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 3/8] Find the ERA5 netcdf files beside an empty yearly folder

Topoclass creates climate/yearly/ when it starts, so the zarr conversion
looked only there and failed for files placed directly in the climate
folder, as in the TopoPyScale examples (Davos). The folder holding
PLEV_*.nc is used now (fetch_era5.climate_netcdf_dir).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012FMkEYDUJxvxmd3SbUsJfP
